s do businesses reduce by operating a virtual team?','[]','[\"overhead costs\"]',0,'2026-09-14 23:36:49','2026-09-14 23:36:49'),(22,5,'boolean','Remote work helps employees eliminate daily commuting stress.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-14 23:36:49','2026-09-14 23:36:49'),(23,5,'mcq','What do successful companies use to overcome management obstacles?','[\"Specialized project management software\",\"Larger physical office spaces\",\"Mandatory weekend office hours\",\"Traditional paper reporting systems\"]','[\"Specialized project management software\"]',2,'2026-09-14 23:36:49','2026-09-14 23:36:49'),(24,5,'multi','Which of the following are mentioned as benefits of remote work for employees?','[\"Better work-life balance\",\"Higher base salaries\",\"Eliminating daily commuting stress\",\"Free company lunches\",\"Saving valuable time\"]','[\"Better work-life balance\",\"Eliminating daily commuting stress\",\"Saving valuable time\"]',3,'2026-09-14 23:36:49','2026-09-14 23:36:49'),(25,5,'fill','What type of meetings do successful companies implement to overcome remote work obstacles?','[]','[\"daily virtual meetings\"]',4,'2026-09-14 23:36:49','2026-09-14 23:36:49'),(26,6,'fill','What is described as another major concern for companies with decentralized networks?','[]','[\"Cybersecurity\"]',0,'2026-09-14 23:36:58','2026-09-14 23:36:58'),(27,6,'boolean','Companies are finding that employees can be just as productive working from home as in a traditional office.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-14 23:36:58','2026-09-14 23:36:58'),(28,6,'mcq','What is one of the benefits of remote work mentioned for employers?','[\"Increased commute times\",\"Reduced overhead costs for office space\",\"Higher office rent expenses\",\"Elimination of all cybersecurity risks\"]','[\"Reduced overhead costs for office space\"]',2,'2026-09-14 23:36:58','2026-09-14 23:36:58'),(29,6,'multi','Which of the following are mentioned as benefits or positive outcomes for employees working remotely?','[\"Hi