he long-term sustainability and vitality of what areas? Fill in the exact word or phrase from the text.','[]','[\"metropolitan areas\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:46:22','2026-09-15 11:46:22'),(446,90,'fill','Complete the phrase: Driven by technological advancements, many companies now allow employees to complete their tasks from ________.','[]','[\"home\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:46:30','2026-09-15 11:46:30'),(447,90,'boolean','True or False: Remote working helps businesses decrease their operational expenses by keeping smaller physical offices.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:46:30','2026-09-15 11:46:30'),(448,90,'mcq','What is one major disadvantage of remote working mentioned in the passage?','[\"Higher daily commuting stress\",\"Increased operational expenses for businesses\",\"Feelings of isolation among some workers\",\"Loss of all technological advancements\"]','[\"Feelings of isolation among some workers\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:46:30','2026-09-15 11:46:30'),(449,90,'multi','Which of the following are mentioned as benefits of remote work in the passage? (Choose all correct answers)','[\"Better work-life balance\",\"Elimination of daily commuting stress\",\"Guaranteed higher salary\",\"Reduction of business operational expenses\"]','[\"Better work-life balance\",\"Elimination of daily commuting stress\",\"Reduction of business operational expenses\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:46:30','2026-09-15 11:46:30'),(450,90,'fill','Complete the phrase: Employees no longer spend hours trapped in traffic, which significantly boosts their daily productivity and overall job ________.','[]','[\"satisfaction\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:46:30','2026-09-15 11:46:30'),(451,91,'fill','Smart thermostats learn household routines and adjust temperatures automatically to reduce _____ waste.','[]','[\"electricity\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:46:39','2026-09-15 11:46:39'),(452,91,'boolean','Connected smart home devices can potentially be hacked by malicious actors.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:46:39','2026-09-15 11:46:39'),(453,91,'mcq','What is one main advantage of smart thermostats mentioned in the text?','[\"They reduce electricity waste.\",\"They allow users to play music.\",\"They provide complete cybersecurity.\",\"They are free to install.\"]','[\"They reduce electricity waste.\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:46:39','2026-09-15 11:46:39'),(454,91,'multi','Which two challenges of smart home technology are mentioned in the text?','[\"Privacy concerns\",\"High initial cost\",\"Slow internet speeds\",\"Lack of smartphone compatibility\",\"Cybersecurity\"]','[\"Privacy concerns\",\"High initial cost\",\"Cybersecurity\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:46:39','2026-09-15 11:46:39'),(455,91,'fill','Homeowners can control lighting, security systems, and heating remotely using their _____.','[]','[\"smartphones\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:46:39','2026-09-15 11:46:39'),(456,92,'fill','Complete the sentence with a exact phrase from the text: Smart thermostats can automatically learn household routines and adjust temperatures to reduce ________.','[]','[\"electricity waste\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:46:47','2026-09-15 11:46:47'),(457,92,'boolean','Are smart thermostats capable of learning household routines automatically according to the text?','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:46:47','2026-09-15 11:46:47'),(458,92,'mcq','What is one of the main challenges associated with smart home devices mentioned in the passage?','[\"Difficulty in connecting to the internet\",\"Privacy concerns due to data collection\",\"Lack of voice-activated assistants\",\"Constant malfunctions of security cameras\"]','[\"Privacy concerns due to data collection\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:46:47','2026-09-15 11:46:47'),(459,92,'multi','Which TWO benefits of smart home technology are explicitly mentioned in the text?','[\"Improving energy efficiency\",\"Eliminating all household chores\",\"Providing greater convenience\",\"Guaranteed free installation\"]','[\"Improving energy efficiency\",\"Providing greater convenience\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:46:47','2026-09-15 11:46:47'),(460,92,'fill','Complete the sentence with an exact word or phrase from the text: Advanced security cameras allow users to monitor their properties ________ while they are away.','[]','[\"remotely\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:46:47','2026-09-15 11:46:47'),(461,93,'fill','Smart thermostats learn user preferences over time and adjust temperatures automatically to save _________.','[]','[\"energy\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:46:54','2026-09-15 11:46:54'),(462,93,'boolean','Advanced security cameras can send video feeds directly to a mobile device.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:46:54','2026-09-15 11:46:54'),(463,93,'mcq','What is one potential risk of increased home connectivity mentioned in the text?','[\"High electricity bills\",\"Privacy risks from hackers\",\"Complex installation processes\",\"Frequent device malfunction\"]','[\"Privacy risks from hackers\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:46:54','2026-09-15 11:46:54'),(464,93,'multi','Which two measures do cybersecurity experts recommend to protect smart devices?','[\"Update passwords regularly\",\"Turn off the internet connection\",\"Use encrypted connections\",\"Replace devices every year\"]','[\"Update passwords regular\",\"Use encrypted connections\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:46:54','2026-09-15 11:46:54'),(465,93,'fill','Homeowners can control their lighting, heating, and security systems remotely using smartphones or voice _________.','[]','[\"assistants\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:46:54','2026-09-15 11:46:54'),(466,94,'fill','Smart thermostats can learn a homeowner\'s daily schedule and adjust the temperature automatically, which significantly reduces ____.','[]','[\"electricity bills\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:47:02','2026-09-15 11:47:02'),(467,94,'boolean','Advanced security cameras allow owners to monitor their property remotely using a smartphone application.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:47:02','2026-09-15 11:47:02'),(468,94,'mcq','What is one of the primary aims of smart home innovations according to the text?','[\"To replace all human labor\",\"To improve energy efficiency\",\"To eliminate internet bills\",\"To generate renewable power\"]','[\"To improve energy efficiency\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:47:02','2026-09-15 11:47:02'),(469,94,'multi','Which of the following are mentioned in the text as challenges of smart home technology?','[\"Cybersecurity concerns and vulnerability to hacking\",\"The high initial cost of purchasing and installing gadgets\",\"A lack of interest from younger generations\",\"Complicated software updates required every week\"]','[\"Cybersecurity concerns and vulnerability to hacking\",\"The high initial cost of purchasing and installing gadgets\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:47:02','2026-09-15 11:47:02'),(470,94,'fill','Devices such as smart thermostats, automated lighting systems, and voice-activated assistants are becoming increasingly common in households ____.','[]','[\"around the world\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:47:02','2026-09-15 11:47:02'),(471,95,'fill','What time does Anna wake up every Saturday?','[]','[\"seven o\'clock\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:57:19','2026-09-15 11:57:19'),(472,95,'boolean','Anna cleans her apartment and listens to music after breakfast on Saturdays.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:57:19','2026-09-15 11:57:19'),(473,95,'mcq','Where does Anna usually go in the afternoon on Saturdays?','[\"To the local supermarket\",\"To a large bookstore\",\"To the city park\",\"To her office\"]','[\"To the local supermarket\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:57:19','2026-09-15 11:57:19'),(474,95,'multi','What does Anna like to do on Sundays? (Choose two correct answers)','[\"Relax in the park\",\"Clean her apartment\",\"Read interesting books\",\"Buy fresh vegetables\"]','[\"Relax in the park\",\"Read interesting books\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:57:19','2026-09-15 11:57:19'),(475,95,'fill','What does Anna eat for breakfast with her butter?','[]','[\"toast\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:57:19','2026-09-15 11:57:19'),(476,96,'fill','What time does the writer wake up on Saturday?','[]','[\"8 o\'clock\"]',0,'2026-09-15 11:57:40','2026-09-15 11:57:40'),(477,96,'boolean','The writer goes to the supermarket in the morning.','[]','[\"False\"]',1,'2026-09-15 11:57:40','2026-09-15 11:57:40'),(478,96,'mcq','What does the writer do on Sunday?','[\"Clean the small apartment\",\"Visit parents near the city center\",\"Buy fresh vegetables and milk\",\"Wash clothes in the afternoon\"]','[\"Visit parents near the city center\"]',2,'2026-09-15 11:57:40','2026-09-15 11:57:40'),(479,96,'multi','Which of the following items does the writer buy at the supermarket? (Choose all correct answers)','[\"Fresh vegetables\",\"Hot coffee\",\"Milk\",\"Eggs\",\"Butter\"]','[\"Fresh vegetables\",\"Milk\",\"Eggs\"]',3,'2026-09-15 11:57:40','2026-09-15 11:57:40'),(480,96,'fill','Where do the writer\'s parents live?','[]','[\"a quiet neighborhood\"]',4,'2026-09-15 11:57:40','2026-09-15 11:57:40'),(481,97,'fill','What kind of book does the old man read?','[]','[\"thick book\"]',0,'2026-09-15 23:41:08','2026-09-15 23:41:08'),(482,97,'boolean','Linh and Nam go to the park with their parents.','[]','[\"False\"]',1,'2026-09-15 23:41:08','2026-09-15 23:41:08'),(483,97,'mcq','At what time do Linh and Nam go home?','[\"Nine o\'clock\",\"Ten o\'clock\",\"Eleven o\'clock\",\"Twelve o\'clock\"]','[\"Eleven o\'clock\"]',2,'2026-09-15 23:41:08','2026-09-15 23:41:08'),(484,97,'multi','What food and drinks do Linh and Nam bring to the park? (Choose all correct answers)','[\"sweet apples\",\"fresh water\",\"hot tea\",\"cold milk\"]','[\"sweet apples\",\"fresh water\"]',3,'2026-09-15 23:41:08','2026-09-15 23:41:08'),(485,97,'fill','What color is the ball that Linh and Nam bring?','[]','[\"red ball\"]',4,'2026-09-15 23:41:08','2026-09-15 23:41:08'),(486,98,'fill','What time does Anna wake up every Saturday?','[]','[\"at 8 o\'clock in the morning\"]',0,'2026-09-15 23:41:15','2026-09-15 23:41:15'),(487,98,'boolean','Anna goes to the supermarket on Sunday.','[]','[\"False\"]',1,'2026-09-15 23:41:15','2026-09-15 23