"At eight o\'clock\"]',2,'2026-09-17 03:28:37','2026-09-17 03:28:37'),(499,100,'multi','Which of the following activities does Anna do on Saturday afternoon?','[\"Clean her living room\",\"Listen to jazz music\",\"Bake chocolate cookies with Linh\",\"Read a book on her sofa\"]','[\"Clean her living room\",\"Listen to jazz music\",\"Bake chocolate cookies with Linh\"]',3,'2026-09-17 03:28:37','2026-09-17 03:28:37'),(500,100,'fill','Where does Anna spend two hours reading a book on Sunday evening?','[]','[\"on my comfortable sofa\"]',4,'2026-09-17 03:28:37','2026-09-17 03:28:37'),(501,101,'fill','What kind of hat does Anna usually wear?','[]','[\"comfortable blue hat\"]',0,'2026-09-17 03:29:51','2026-09-17 03:29:51'),(502,101,'boolean','Anna goes to the park every Sunday morning.','[]','[\"False\"]',1,'2026-09-17 03:29:51','2026-09-17 03:29:51'),(503,101,'mcq','What does Anna sometimes do on a wooden bench?','[\"Sleep for an hour\",\"Read her favorite book\",\"Talk on her phone\",\"Draw pictures of trees\"]','[\"Read her favorite book\"]',2,'2026-09-17 03:29:51','2026-09-17 03:29:51'),(504,101,'multi','Which of the following flowers are mentioned in the text? (Select all that apply)','[\"red roses\",\"white lilies\",\"yellow sunflowers\",\"pink tulips\"]','[\"red roses\",\"yellow sunflowers\"]',3,'2026-09-17 03:29:51','2026-09-17 03:29:51'),(505,101,'fill','At what time does Anna walk back home to eat lunch?','[]','[\"twelve o\'clock\"]',4,'2026-09-17 03:29:51','2026-09-17 03:29:51'),(506,102,'fill','What does Linh\'s father like to do on the wooden bench?','[]','[\"read a newspaper\"]',0,'2026-09-17 03:31:03','2026-09-17 03:31:03'),(507,102,'boolean','Linh goes to the park with her family every Sunday.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-17 03:31:03','2026-09-17 03:31:03'),(508,102,'mcq','What time do they usually go home?','[\"At four o\'clock\",\"At five o\'clock\",\"At six o\'clock\",\"At seven o\'clock\"]','[\"At five o\'clock\"]',2,'2026-09-17 03:31:03','2026-09-17 03:31:03'),(509,102,'multi','What things does Linh see or take pictures of in the park? (Choose two)','[\"colorful flowers\",\"cute birds\",\"wild animals\",\"tall buildings\"]','[\"colorful flowers\",\"cute birds\"]',3,'2026-09-17 03:31:03','2026-09-17 03:31:03'),(510,102,'fill','What do they always eat in the afternoon?','[]','[\"sandwiches\"]',4,'2026-09-17 03:31:03','2026-09-17 03:31:03'),(511,103,'fill','What time do Linh and Nam walk back home?','[]','[\"eleven o\'clock\"]',0,'2026-09-17 03:31:43','2026-09-17 03:31:43'),(512,103,'boolean','Linh goes to the park with her younger brother Nam.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-17 03:31:43','2026-09-17 03:31:43'),(513,103,'mcq','What does Nam do at the pond?','[\"He feeds the brown ducks.\",\"He swims in the water.\",\"He takes pictures of flowers.\",\"He reads a book on a bench.\"]','[\"He feeds the brown ducks.\"]',2,'2026-09-17 03:31:43','2026-09-17 03:31:43'),(514,103,'multi','What are two things Linh and Nam do or see at the park? Select all correct answers.','[\"Linh takes pictures of flowers and trees.\",\"Nam buys bread to feed the ducks.\",\"They play football on the grass with children.\",\"They walk back home at eleven o\'clock.\"]','[\"Linh takes pictures of flowers and trees.\",\"Nam buys bread to feed the ducks.\",\"They walk back home at eleven o\'clock.\"]',3,'2026-09-17 03:31:43','2026-09-17 03:31:43'),(515,103,'fill','What color is Linh\'s camera?','[]','[\"pink\"]',4,'2026-09-17 03:31:43','2026-09-17 03:31:43'),(516,104,'fill','What kind of shoes do you need to start walking?','[]','[\"comfortable pair of shoes\"]',0,'2026-09-20 21:30:00','2026-09-20 21:30:00'),(517,104,'boolean','Walking for thirty minutes a day can help strengthen your heart.','[]','[\"True\"]',1,'2026-09-20 21:30:00','2026-09-20 21:30:00'),(518,104,'mcq','Why do some people prefer to walk in the morning?','[\"To save money on gas\",\"To get extra energy for the day\",\"To buy groceries for dinner\",\"To avoid the evening traffic\"]','[\"To get extra energy for the day\"]',2,'2026-09-20 21:30:00','2026-09-20 21:30:00'),(519,104,'multi','What are two benefits of taking a brisk walk daily according to the text?','[\"strengthen your heart\",\"reduce stress levels\",\"save money on gym membership\",\"improve your English skills\"]','[\"strengthen your heart\",\"reduce stress levels\"]',3,'2026-09-20 21:30:00','2026-09-20 21:30:00'),(520,104,'fill','Where do some people like to walk in the evening to relax?','[]','[\"evening\"]',4,'2026-09-20 21:30:00','2026-09-20 21:30:00');
