INSERT INTO `grammar_questions` VALUES (421,13,'multi','Select ALL sentences that correctly use \'remember\' followed by an infinitive (to V) or gerund (V-ing) with correct meaning:','[\"I remember locking the door before I left.\",\"Remember locking the door tomorrow morning.\",\"Remember to lock the door before you leave.\",\"I remember to lock the door yesterday.\"]','[\"I remember locking the door before I left.\",\"Remember to lock the door before you leave.\"]',0,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(422,13,'fill','I would rather stay home ___ go out in this heavy rain.','[]','[\"than\"]',1,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(423,13,'mcq','Complete the sentence: Let\'s ___ a picnic in the park this Sunday.','[\"having\",\"to have\",\"have\",\"had\"]','[\"have\"]',2,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(424,13,'multi','Select ALL sentences that correctly use \'enough\' based on the reference material:','[\"She is old enough to drive.\",\"We don\'t have enough time.\",\"He is enough smart to pass.\",\"They have enough money to travel.\"]','[\"She is old enough to drive.\",\"We don\'t have enough time.\",\"They have enough money to travel.\"]',3,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(425,13,'fill','Let me ___ you carry those heavy grocery bags.','[]','[\"help\"]',4,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(426,13,'mcq','Choose the correct option: The test was ___ difficult that nobody passed it.','[\"such\",\"so\",\"too\",\"enough\"]','[\"so\"]',5,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(427,13,'mcq','Complete the sentence: ___ the heavy traffic, she arrived at the meeting on time.','[\"Although\",\"Even though\",\"Despite\",\"Because\"]','[\"Despite\"]',6,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(428,13,'mcq','Select the correct sentence with inversion using \'Not only\':','[\"Not only he was tired, but he was also hungry.\",\"Not only was he tired, but he was also hungry.\",\"Not only he is tired, but also he is hungry.\",\"Not only is tired, but also hungry.\"]','[\"Not only was he tired, but he was also hungry.\"]',7,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(429,13,'fill','It was not until midnight ___ he finally stopped working.','[]','[\"that\"]',8,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(430,13,'mcq','Choose the correct structure: \'I find ___ difficult to understand native speakers.\'','[\"this\",\"that\",\"it\",\"them\"]','[\"it\"]',9,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(431,13,'mcq','Choose the correct option: I am used to ___ up early every single day.','[\"wake\",\"waking\",\"woke\",\"have woken\"]','[\"waking\"]',10,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(432,13,'mcq','Which option follows the rule for \'suggest\':','[\"I suggest that he visits a doctor.\",\"I suggest that he visit a doctor.\",\"I suggest him to visit a doctor.\",\"I suggest he visiting a doctor.\"]','[\"I suggest that he visit a doctor.\"]',11,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(433,13,'mcq','Complete the sentence for purpose: She whispered ___ no one could hear her conversation.','[\"so that\",\"in order to\",\"to\",\"so as not\"]','[\"so that\"]',12,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(434,13,'fill','I suggest ___ early in the morning to avoid the city traffic.','[]','[\"leaving\"]',13,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(435,13,'multi','Select ALL options that can correctly fill the blank: \'___ the heavy rain, we decided to stay indoors.\'','[\"Despite\",\"In spite of\",\"Although\",\"Because of\",\"Even though\"]','[\"Despite\",\"In spite of\",\"Because of\"]',14,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(436,13,'fill','We hope that our grandmother ___ better very soon.','[]','[\"gets\"]',15,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(437,13,'multi','Select ALL verbs from the list below that are always followed by a gerund (V-ing) according to the material:','[\"enjoy\",\"avoid\",\"refuse\",\"consider\",\"promise\"]','[\"enjoy\",\"avoid\",\"consider\"]',16,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(438,13,'fill','The teacher asked the students ___ quiet during the exam.','[]','[\"to remain\"]',17,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(439,13,'fill','You had better take an umbrella, ___ you will get soaked outside.','[]','[\"or\"]',18,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(440,13,'multi','Select ALL sentences that correctly use \'prefer\' according to the reference material:','[\"I prefer tea to coffee.\",\"I prefer walking than driving.\",\"I prefer to walk rather than drive.\",\"She prefers reading books to watching films.\",\"She prefers watch TV than read.\"]','[\"I prefer tea to coffee.\",\"I prefer to walk rather than drive.\",\"She prefers reading books to watching films.\"]',19,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(441,13,'mcq','Choose the correct sentence using \'would rather\':','[\"I\'d rather you don\'t park your car here.\",\"I\'d rather you didn\'t park your car here.\",\"I\'d rather you won\'t park your car here.\",\"I\'d rather you aren\'t parking your car here.\"]','[\"I\'d rather you didn\'t park your car here.\"]',20,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(442,13,'mcq','Complete the sentence with \'unless\': You will fail the course ___ you submit your assignment.','[\"if\",\"unless\",\"when\",\"because\"]','[\"unless\"]',21,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(443,13,'multi','Select ALL sentences that correctly use \'There is\' or \'There are\' with the correct noun agreement:','[\"There is a cat on the roof.\",\"There are three books on the table.\",\"There is some milk in the fridge.\",\"There are a dog in the yard.\"]','[\"There is a cat on the roof.\",\"There are three books on the table.\",\"There is some milk in the fridge.\"]',22,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(444,13,'fill','Would you like ___ to the party with us this weekend?','[]','[\"to come\"]',23,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(445,13,'fill','Mark promised ___ all the project reports by tomorrow afternoon.','[]','[\"to finish\"]',24,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(446,13,'multi','Select ALL options that correctly express purpose using \'to V\', \'in order to\', or \'so as not to\' with the base form:','[\"She saved money to buy a new phone.\",\"He arrived early in order to get a good seat.\",\"He left early to avoid the traffic.\",\"She whispered so as not to waking him up.\"]','[\"She saved money to buy a new phone.\",\"He arrived early in order to get a good seat.\",\"He left early to avoid the traffic.\"]',25,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(447,13,'fill','The manager advised him ___ the contract before signing it.','[]','[\"to read\"]',26,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(448,13,'mcq','Select the correct sentence using \'advise\':','[\"She advised to take a break.\",\"She advised taking a break.\",\"She advised take a break.\",\"She advised for taking a break.\"]','[\"She advised taking a break.\"]',27,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(449,13,'mcq','Choose the correct form: You had better ___ late for the interview.','[\"not be\",\"to not be\",\"not to be\",\"don\'t be\"]','[\"not be\"]',28,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(450,13,'mcq','What is the difference between stop + V-ing and stop + to V? \'He stopped ___ a coffee.\' means he paused his driving to buy one.','[\"drinking\",\"drink\",\"to drink\",\"drank\"]','[\"to drink\"]',29,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(451,13,'fill','He enjoys ___ classical music while working in his office.','[]','[\"listening\"]',30,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(452,13,'fill','Despite ___ very tired, she finished her homework.','[]','[\"being\"]',31,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(453,13,'fill','She prefers reading books ___ watching television.','[]','[\"to\"]',32,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(454,13,'mcq','Select the sentence with the correct use of \'regret\' (feeling sorry about a past action):','[\"I regret to lend him money.\",\"I regret lending him money.\",\"I regret for lending him money.\",\"I regret that lend him money.\"]','[\"I regret lending him money.\"]',33,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(455,13,'fill','This wooden floor needs ___ before we paint it.','[]','[\"sanding\"]',34,'2026-09-16 12:24:30','2026-09-16 12:24:30'),(456,14,'mcq','Choose the correct sentence using \'It was not until...\':','[\"It was not until 9 PM that she arrived.\",\"It was not until 9 PM when she arrived.\",\"It was not until 9 PM then she arrived.\",\"It was not until 9 PM arrived she.\"]','[\"It was not until 9 PM that she arrived.\"]',0,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(457,14,'mcq','Choose the correct contrast conjunction: \'___ the heavy traffic, we arrived on time.\'','[\"Although\",\"Despite\",\"Because\",\"Even though\"]','[\"Despite\"]',1,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(458,14,'fill','There ___ many people waiting outside the theater.','[]','[\"are\"]',2,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(459,14,'fill','The teacher let him ___ the classroom early.','[]','[\"leave\"]',3,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(460,14,'fill','She whispered ___ that she would not wake the sleeping baby.','[]','[\"so\"]',4,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(461,14,'multi','Which of the following statements about \'There is / There are\' are correct?','[\"They are used to introduce new information.\",\"\'There\' acts as a real subject determining verb agreement.\",\"The real subject comes after the verb.\",\"They can be used in past and future tenses.\"]','[\"They are used to introduce new information.\",\"The real subject comes after the verb.\",\"They can be used in past and future tenses.\"]',5,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(462,14,'mcq','Complete the sentence: \'She advised him ___ the contract before signing.\'','[\"read\",\"to read\",\"reading\",\"reads\"]','[\"to read\"]',6,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(463,14,'mcq','Complete the sentence: \'It was ___ an interesting book that I finished it in one day.\'','[\"so\",\"such\",\"too\",\"enough\"]','[\"such\"]',7,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(464,14,'mcq','Choose the correct sentence with \'Unless\':','[\"Unless you don\'t hurry, you will be late.\",\"Unless you hurry, you will be late.\",\"Unless you will hurry, you will be late.\",\"Unless to hurry, you will be late.\"]','[\"Unless you hurry, you will be late.\"]',8,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(465,14,'mcq','Complete the sentence: \'There ___ a lot of noise outside yesterday.\'','[\"was\",\"were\",\"is\",\"are\"]','[\"was\"]',9,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(466,14,'mcq','Identify the correct structure: \'He is ___ young to drive a car.\'','[\"so\",\"such\",\"too\",\"enough\"]','[\"too\"]',10,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(467,14,'mcq','Complete the sentence: \'He is not tall ___ to reach the top shelf.\'','[\"too\",\"enough\",\"so\",\"such\"]','[\"enough\"]',11,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(468,14,'fill','You had better ___ your homework before watching television.','[]','[\"finish\"]',12,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(469,14,'fill','This car is dirty; it needs ___.','[]','[\"washing\"]',13,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(470,14,'fill','Despite ___ hard, she failed the entrance examination.','[]','[\"studying\"]',14,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(471,14,'mcq','Select the correct form: \'I am used to ___ up early in the morning.\'','[\"wake\",\"waking\",\"woke\",\"be wake\"]','[\"waking\"]',15,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(472,14,'multi','Which of the following sentences correctly use the \'suggest\' structure followed by a V-ing or a clause?','[\"I suggest staying at this hotel.\",\"I suggest she to study harder.\",\"I suggest that he see a manager.\",\"I suggest to book tickets early.\"]','[\"I suggest staying at this hotel.\",\"I suggest that he see a manager.\"]',16,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(473,14,'mcq','Identify the correct form: \'She suggested that he ___ a doctor immediately.\'','[\"sees\",\"see\",\"seeing\",\"saw\"]','[\"see\"]',17,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(474,14,'mcq','Select the correct option: \'He refused ___ the document without his lawyer present.\'','[\"sign\",\"signing\",\"to sign\",\"signed\"]','[\"to sign\"]',18,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(475,14,'mcq','Complete the sentence: \'___ finishing his project, he went out with his friends.\'','[\"When\",\"While\",\"After\",\"Because\"]','[\"After\"]',19,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(476,14,'multi','Identify the correct pairings of \'remember\' with its meanings according to the material:','[\"Remember + V-ing means recalling a past action.\",\"Remember + V-ing means not forgetting a future task.\",\"Remember + to V means recalling a past action.\",\"Remember + to V means not forgetting a future task.\"]','[\"Remember + V-ing means recalling a past action.\",\"Remember + to V means not forgetting a future task.\"]',20,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(477,14,'multi','Which of the following verbs are correctly followed by a gerund (V-ing) according to the material?','[\"enjoy\",\"refuse\",\"avoid\",\"promise\",\"consider\"]','[\"enjoy\",\"avoid\",\"consider\"]',21,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(478,14,'fill','It was not until yesterday ___ he received his visa.','[]','[\"that\"]',22,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(479,14,'mcq','Choose the correct sentence following the structure of \'would rather\' for another person:','[\"I\'d rather you go now.\",\"I\'d rather you went now.\",\"I\'d rather you to go now.\",\"I\'d rather you going now.\"]','[\"I\'d rather you went now.\"]',23,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(480,14,'fill','I suggest ___ a taxi so we don\'t miss the flight.','[]','[\"taking\"]',24,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(481,14,'fill','I remember ___ the lights before leaving the house this morning.','[]','[\"turning off\"]',25,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(482,14,'fill','The test was ___ difficult that nobody achieved a passing score.','[]','[\"so\"]',26,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(483,14,'fill','I would rather you ___ talk loudly in the library.','[]','[\"didn\'t\"]',27,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(484,14,'multi','Which of the following expressions can be followed directly by a base form of a verb (V)?','[\"would rather\",\"had better\",\"let + object\",\"be used to\"]','[\"would rather\",\"had better\",\"let + object\"]',28,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(485,14,'mcq','Choose the correct option: \'He stopped ___ a phone call while driving.\'','[\"answering\",\"to answer\",\"answer\",\"answered\"]','[\"to answer\"]',29,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(486,14,'multi','Which of the following sentences correctly demonstrate the usage of \'Too\' or \'Enough\'?','[\"She is too young to drive.\",\"She is old enough to drive.\",\"We have enough time to finish.\",\"We have time enough to finish.\"]','[\"She is too young to drive.\",\"She is old enough to drive.\",\"We have enough time to finish.\"]',30,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(487,14,'fill','He regrets ___ the job offer because he is now unemployed.','[]','[\"rejecting\"]',31,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(488,14,'fill','When I entered the room, everyone ___ singing happily.','[]','[\"was\"]',32,'2026-09-16 12:24:47','2026-09-16 12:24:47'),(489,14,'multi','Select all options that can correctly follow \'Despite\' or \'In spite of\' in a sentence.','[\"a noun phrase\",\"a full clause with a subject and verb\",\"an -ing verb form\",\"an infinitive verb\"]','[\"a noun phrase\",\"an -ing verb form\"]',33,'2026-09-16 12:24: