','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(620,18,'fill','Jane lost her job last month, so she has ___ money left now.','[]','[\"little\"]',24,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(621,18,'multi','Select all linking verbs from the following list:','[\"seem\",\"run\",\"become\",\"feel\",\"jump\"]','[\"seem\",\"become\",\"feel\"]',25,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(622,18,'fill','Can you pass me ___ salt on the kitchen counter?','[]','[\"the\"]',26,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(623,18,'mcq','Choose the correct possessive pronoun to fill in the blank: \'This jacket is mine, and that one is ___.\'','[\"her\",\"his\",\"your\",\"my\"]','[\"his\"]',27,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(624,18,'fill','That modern glass table was ___ in 2015.','[]','[\"built\"]',28,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(625,18,'fill','She is the woman ___ name is displayed on the board.','[]','[\"whose\"]',29,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(626,18,'mcq','Identify the linking verb in this sentence: \'The homemade soup smells delicious.\'','[\"soup\",\"smells\",\"delicious\",\"homemade\"]','[\"smells\"]',30,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(627,18,'mcq','Which of the following is an uncountable noun?','[\"book\",\"information\",\"camera\",\"city\"]','[\"information\"]',31,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(628,18,'mcq','What kind of adverb is \'downstairs\' in the sentence \'Mary is waiting downstairs\'?','[\"Adverb of time\",\"Adverb of place\",\"Adverb of degree\",\"Adverb of manner\"]','[\"Adverb of place\"]',32,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(629,18,'fill','John is neither a doctor ___ an engineer.','[]','[\"nor\"]',33,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(630,18,'mcq','Identify the modal verb in the following sentence: \'Jane can speak three languages fluently.\'','[\"Jane\",\"can\",\"speak\",\"fluently\"]','[\"can\"]',34,'2026-09-20 21:49:23','2026-09-20 21:49:23'),(316,10,'mcq','Choose the correct tag question for: \'They rarely visit their hometown.\'','[\"don\'t they?\",\"do they?\",\"aren\'t they?\",\"are they?\"]','[\"do they?\"]',0,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(317,10,'fill','___ aren\'t we leaving for the airport right now?','[]','[\"Why\"]',1,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(318,10,'mcq','Choose the correct indirect question based on: \'Where is the exit?\'','[\"Can you tell me where is the exit?\",\"Can you tell me where the exit is?\",\"Can you tell me is the exit where?\",\"Can you tell me where does the exit?\"]','[\"Can you tell me where the exit is?\"]',2,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(319,10,'multi','Select all sentences that demonstrate correct Tag Question polarity (affirmative statement to negative tag, or negative statement to positive tag).','[\"You can swim, can\'t you?\",\"She doesn\'t like seafood, does she?\",\"They are arriving today, are they?\",\"He has finished his homework, hasn\'t he?\",\"We won\'t be late, won\'t we?\"]','[\"You can swim, can\'t you?\",\"She doesn\'t like seafood, does she?\",\"He has finished his homework, hasn\'t he?\"]',3,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(320,10,'fill','___ she ever visited London before last summer?','[]','[\"Had\"]',4,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(321,10,'fill','___ you like some more coffee with your breakfast?','[]','[\"Would\"]',5,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(322,10,'fill','___ you finished reading that interesting book yet?','[]','[\"Have\"]',6,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(323,10,'mcq','Which sentence is a grammatically correct Yes/No question in the present continuous tense?','[\"Is she working on her project?\",\"Does she working on her project?\",\"She is working on her project?\",\"Works she on her project?\"]','[\"Is she working on her project?\"]',7,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(324,10,'mcq','Which sentence demonstrates a correct negative question making a polite suggestion?','[\"Don\'t you think we should leave now?\",\"Why you don\'t leave now?\",\"You shouldn\'t leave now, do you?\",\"Isn\'t leave now good?\"]','[\"Don\'t you think we should leave now?\"]',8,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(325,10,'mcq','Select the correct indirect question.','[\"Could you tell me what time the train leaves?\",\"Could you tell me what time leaves the train?\",\"Could you tell me does the train leave at what time?\",\"Could you tell me what time does the train leave?\"]','[\"Could you tell me what time the train leaves?\"]',9,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(326,10,'fill','___ wasn\'t that movie absolutely fantastic?','[]','[\"Why\"]',10,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(327,10,'multi','Select all sentences that contain grammatically correct Indirect Questions with proper normal statement word order.','[\"Could you tell me where the station is?\",\"Do you know what time the bank opens?\",\"Can you explain why she is upset?\",\"I want to know where is my bag.\",\"Please tell me how does this machine work.\"]','[\"Could you tell me where the station is?\",\"Do you know what time the bank opens?\",\"Can you explain why she is upset?\"]',11,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(328,10,'fill','Do you know what time the library ___ on Saturdays?','[]','[\"opens\"]',12,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(329,10,'fill','She speaks three different languages fluently, ___ she?','[]','[\"doesn\'t\"]',13,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(330,10,'fill','He has never been abroad before, ___ he?','[]','[\"has\"]',14,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(331,10,'mcq','Which of the following is a correct choice question?','[\"Do you like apples or do you like bananas?\",\"Would you prefer tea or coffee?\",\"You like coffee or tea?\",\"What do you want tea or coffee?\"]','[\"Would you prefer tea or coffee?\"]',15,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(332,10,'mcq','