2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(339,10,'multi','Select all statements that accurately describe Yes/No Questions based on the reference material.','[\"The answer to the question is yes or no.\",\"The auxiliary verb comes before the subject.\",\"They begin with question words like what or where.\",\"They use normal statement word order without inversion.\",\"An example structure is: Auxiliary verb + subject + verb ...?\"]','[\"The answer to the question is yes or no.\",\"The auxiliary verb comes before the subject.\",\"An example structure is: Auxiliary verb + subject + verb ...?\"]',23,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(340,10,'mcq','Select the correct choice question.','[\"Would you like to drive or should I take the wheel?\",\"Do you want pizza or pasta for dinner?\",\"What do you want pizza or pasta?\",\"Do you like pizza, or do you want pasta?\"]','[\"Do you want pizza or pasta for dinner?\"]',24,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(341,10,'multi','Select all statements that correctly describe the rules of Indirect Questions based on the reference material.','[\"They are more polite questions.\",\"They use subject-auxiliary inversion just like direct questions.\",\"They are embedded so that the word order returns to normal statement order.\",\"They contain question words like where or what.\",\"They always end with a negative auxiliary verb.\"]','[\"They are more polite questions.\",\"They are embedded so that the word order returns to normal statement order.\"]',25,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(342,10,'mcq','Select the correct tag question for the statement: \'Mark is an excellent programmer.\'','[\"is he?\",\"isn\'t he?\",\"does he?\",\"doesn\'t he?\"]','[\"isn\'t he?\"]',26,'2026-09-16 12:23:44','2026-09-16 12:23:44'),(343,10,'multi','Select all sentences that are grammatically correct Wh-Questions according to the reference material.','[\"Where do you live?\",\"What time does the train leave?\",\"Why you are crying?\",\"How did you 