9-20 21:48:07'),(562,17,'mcq','Identify the correct structure for an annoying habit using \'always\' in the Present Continuous:','[\"You always lose your keys!\",\"You are always losing your keys!\",\"You always losing your keys!\",\"You have always lost your keys!\"]','[\"You are always losing your keys!\"]',1,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(563,17,'mcq','Which option demonstrates a plan or intention decided before the moment of speaking?','[\"I will buy a new car next month.\",\"I am going to buy a new car next month.\",\"I buy a new car next month.\",\"I have bought a new car next month.\"]','[\"I am going to buy a new car next month.\"]',2,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(564,17,'fill','By the time we arrived at the station, the train ___ (leave).','[]','[\"had left\"]',3,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(565,17,'mcq','Identify the Future Continuous sentence structure:','[\"Subject + will + V\",\"Subject + will be + V-ing\",\"Subject + will have + V3\",\"Subject + will have been + V-ing\"]','[\"Subject + will be + V-ing\"]',4,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(566,17,'mcq','Choose the sentence that correctly expresses a Future in the Past:','[\"He said he will help.\",\"He said he would help.\",\"He says he will help.\",\"He said he is going to help.\"]','[\"He said he would help.\"]',5,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(567,17,'fill','She is tired because she ___ (run) for over an hour.','[]','[\"has been running\"]',6,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(568,17,'mcq','Which signal word is most commonly used with the Past Perfect to show the \'earlier\' past?','[\"now\",\"at the moment\",\"before\",\"currently\"]','[\"before\"]',7,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(569,17,'fill','By next month, they ___ (live) in this city for five years.','[]','[\"will have lived\"]',8,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(570,17,'fill','By 2028, she ___ (graduate) from university.','[]','[\"will have graduated\"]',9,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(571,17,'mcq','Which tense is used to emphasize the duration of an action up to a specific point in the past?','[\"Past Simple\",\"Past Continuous\",\"Past Perfect\",\"Past Perfect Continuous\"]','[\"Past Perfect Continuous\"]',10,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(572,17,'multi','Which signal words can be used with the Future Simple (will) tense? (Select all that apply)','[\"tomorrow\",\"next week\",\"I think\",\"since\",\"probably\"]','[\"tomorrow\",\"next week\",\"I think\",\"probably\"]',11,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(573,17,'multi','Which of the following sentences correctly use the Past Simple tense? (Select all that apply)','[\"We visited Paris last year.\",\"They watched a movie yesterday.\",\"He has finished his homework.\",\"It was raining.\",\"She came in, took off her coat and sat down.\"]','[\"We visited Paris last year.\",\"They watched a movie yesterday.\",\"She came in, took off her coat and sat down.\"]',12,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(574,17,'fill','They ___ (visit) their grandparents last weekend.','[]','[\"visited\"]',13,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(575,17,'multi','Which signal words are listed for the Future Perfect tense? (Select all that apply)','[\"by the time\",\"by next week\",\"at 8 pm last night\",\"by 2050\",\"yesterday\"]','[\"by the time\",\"by next week\",\"by 2050\"]',14,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(576,17,'mcq','Which tense is used to describe a sequence of past actions in a story?','[\"Past Continuous\",\"Past Perfect\",\"Past Simple\",\"Present Perfect\"]','[\"Past Simple\"]',15,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(577,17,'multi','Which of the following signal words are commonly used with the Present Simple tense? (Select all that apply)','[\"always\",\"yesterday\",\"every day\",\"usually\",\"at this time tomorrow\"]','[\"always\",\"every day\",\"usually\"]',16,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(578,17,'fill','I ___ (be) to Australia three times in my life.','[]','[\"have been\"]',17,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(579,17,'fill','He ___ (not finish) his assignment yet; he is still working on it.','[]','[\"has not finished\"]',18,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(580,17,'fill','Please turn down the music; I ___ (study) for my exam right now.','[]','[\"am studying\"]',19,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(581,17,'mcq','Choose the correct sentence for a spontaneous decision:','[\"I am going to help you with that bag.\",\"I will help you with that bag.\",\"I help you with that bag.\",\"I am helping you with that bag.\"]','[\"I will help you with that bag.\"]',20,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(582,17,'mcq','Which sentence correctly uses the Present Simple for a fixed timetable?','[\"The train leaves at 8 pm.\",\"The train is leaving at 8 pm.\",\"The train will leave at 8 pm.\",\"The train has left at 8 pm.\"]','[\"The train leaves at 8 pm.\"]',21,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(583,17,'multi','Which signal words are associated with the Present Perfect tense? (Select all that apply)','[\"just\",\"already\",\"yet\",\"while\",\"since\"]','[\"just\",\"already\",\"yet\",\"since\"]',22,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(584,17,'mcq','Which of these signal words is typically used with the Present Perfect for actions continuing from the past?','[\"yesterday\",\"since\",\"at 8 pm last night\",\"tomorrow\"]','[\"since\"]',23,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(585,17,'fill','She ___ (work) at the local hospital every weekday.','[]','[\"works\"]',24,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(586,17,'fill','He said that he ___ (come) to the party the following day.','[]','[\"would come\"]',25,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(587,17,'mcq','Which sentence describes an interrupted action in the past?','[\"I studied English yesterday.\",\"He was watching TV when the phone rang.\",\"She had finished her work before she went home.\",\"They watched a movie.\"]','[\"He was watching TV when the phone rang.\"]',26,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(588,17,'multi','Which of the following are valid structures for expressing Future in the Past? (Select all that apply)','[\"Subject + would + V\",\"Subject + was/were going to + V\",\"Subject + will have + V3\",\"Subject + was/were to + V\",\"Subject + am/is/are + going to + V\"]','[\"Subject + would + V\",\"Subject + was/were going to + V\",\"Subject + was/were to + V\"]',27,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(589,17,'multi','Which of the following are valid uses of the Present Continuous tense according to the material? (Select all that apply)','[\"Actions happening now\",\"Fixed timetables\",\"Temporary situations\",\"Near future plans\",\"Habits and schedules\"]','[\"Actions happening now\",\"Temporary situations\",\"Near future plans\"]',28,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(590,17,'mcq','Select the correct Future Perfect sentence:','[\"We will finish the project by Monday.\",\"We will be finishing the project by Monday.\",\"We will have finished the project by Monday.\",\"We are going to finish the project by Monday.\"]','[\"We will have finished the project by Monday.\"]',29,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(591,17,'mcq','What is the correct negative form of the Present Perfect for: \'He has finished his homework\'?','[\"He has not finished his homework.\",\"He did not finish his homework.\",\"He was not finishing his homework.\",\"He had not finished his homework.\"]','[\"He has not finished his homework.\"]',30,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(592,17,'fill','While I ___ (cook) dinner, my brother was washing the dishes.','[]','[\"was cooking\"]',31,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(593,17,'fill','If you are cold, I ___ (close) the window for you.','[]','[\"will close\"]',32,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(594,17,'mcq','What does the Present Perfect Continuous emphasize when used with recent continuous actions?','[\"A finished fact\",\"A clear present result from a just-finished action\",\"A fixed schedule\",\"A spontaneous decision\"]','[\"A clear present result from a just-finished action\"]',33,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07'),(595,17,'fill','Look at those dark clouds in the sky! It ___ (rain) soon.','[]','[\"is going to rain\"]',34,'2026-09-20 21:48:07','2026-09-20 21:48:07');
